Phase 5 — Fraud

In: Real XGBoost champion in-process; IEEE-CIS plus synthetic; time-ordered split.
Out: Weighted three-model blend on the hot path; SageMaker.
Done when: score is a dimension, not the decision.

Implementation: XGBoostChampion is the sole scorer on /v1/payments
(timeout ~20ms, UNKNOWN on timeout). Training uses a time-ordered 80/20
split on synthetic IEEE-CIS-shaped rows, with an optional overlay of
data/ieee-cis/train_transaction.csv. SHAP runs only on /explain and is
skipped when the decision was APPROVE. LightGBM blend and SageMaker stay out.
